1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 11=

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,680
Hello, Mr. He.

4
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,880
Why are you wrapping up so late today?

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,200
We don't have any shows these days.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,080
It's all rehearsals.

7
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,000
Everyone left a while ago.

8
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:29,440
Then...

9
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,560
where's Xiyu?

10
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,600
She accompanied the sick Song Shuqi
to the hospital.

11
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:33,880
She never came back after that.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,840
Why did she go with Song Shuqi?

13
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,440
Song Shuqi said

14
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,000
Xiyu's mom is a doctor,

15
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,320
so she knows the hospital better.

16
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,120
Okay.

17
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,680
Goodbye, Mr. He.

18
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,600
Where's Xiyu?

19
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,520
I'm not her mother.

20
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,200
How would I know where she is?

21
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,760
Didn't you ask her to take you
to the hospital?

22
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,240
I did not.

23
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,160
For all I know,

24
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,040
she ran off on a date
with Zhang Jinghang.

25
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,400
I'm giving you one last chance.

26
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,760
Where did you lure Xiyu to?

27
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:03,080
I...

28
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:03,760
don't know.

29
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,440
Talk!

30
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,080
It...

31
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,360
It was the bar owner.

32
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,240
He said

33
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,120
if I got

34
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,440
Luo Xiyu into his car,

35
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,960
he'd delete my video.

36
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,280
I had no choice.

37
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,600
Are you insane?

38
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,520
Do you know how dangerous
Wang Haotian is?

39
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,760
He promised me

40
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,880
he wouldn't hurt her.

41
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,440
Where did Wang Haotian take her?

42
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:26,800
I don't know.

43
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,440
I really don't know that.

44
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,720
(Fulfill the Dream of Rejuvenation)
Wang Haotian took Luo Xiyu.

45
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,840
Go find every place Wang Haotian
might have gone

46
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,440
as fast as possible.

47
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:53,480
How's it?

48
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,320
Looks good, right?

49
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,280
I designed it just for you.

50
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,320
No wonder He Lan likes you.

51
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,080
Look.

52
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:15,680
Look.

53
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,240
The members are about to come online.

54
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,320
I promise,

55
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,200
you'll look very different tonight.

56
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,040
A lot more people are going to like you.

57
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,760
You know what they love most

58
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,360
about innocent girls like you?

59
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:11,960
Look at that.

60
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,160
The more nervous you get,

61
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,400
the more excited they are.

62
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,080
Where did you hide Xiyu?

63
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,960
Calm down.

64
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,280
Let's call the police first.

65
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,000
Okay.

66
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:41,760
(Mr. He,)

67
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,080
(we found an overseas dark-web site.)

68
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,080
(It says they'll livestream
Luo Xiyu dancing tonight.)

69
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,960
Get the best experts you can find.

70
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,960
Do whatever it takes

71
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,320
and find her.

72
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,880
Come on.

73
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,400
Hurry.

74
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,280
They can't wait.

75
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,400
Quit pretending to be innocent.

76
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,240
Were you like this with He Lan too?

77
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,400
If you want to blame someone,
blame He Lan.

78
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,320
He's the reason I'm not a man anymore.

79
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,680
I'm going to make him

80
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,600
a cuckold a thousand times over.

81
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,880
A view this good

82
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,840
shouldn't be mine alone to enjoy.

83
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,400
I'm sorry. I'm late.

84
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,600
Wang Haotian!

85
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,320
Don't go after him!

86
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:46,920
If I let him get away,

87
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,040
he'll do this again.

88
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,080
Don't worry.

89
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:49,800
I've already called the police.

90
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,600
I'll keep an eye on him.

91
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,680
Don't go!

92
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,560
I don't want to lose you again.

93
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,760
Please don't leave.

94
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,520
I don't want you to leave me again.

95
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,280
I don't want you getting hurt.

96
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,320
I'm sorry.

97
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:11,200
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

98
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:11,920
Sorry.

99
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:20,320
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

100
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,440
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

101
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,600
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

102
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,520
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

103
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:34,000
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

104
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,120
Cold?

105
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,200
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

106
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,000
It's okay.

107
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:46,800
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

108
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,200
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

109
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,000
Go ahead.

110
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,920
I'll wait outside.

111
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,320
Wait.

112
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,800
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

113
00:06:56,800 --> 00:07:00,920
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

114
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:03,800
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

115
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:07,200
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

116
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,600
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

117
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,840
Are you sure of this?

118
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:17,680
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

119
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,720
♪I could give you another future♪

120
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:27,160
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

121
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:29,480
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

122
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,120
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

123
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,880
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

124
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:35,160
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

125
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:39,160
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

126
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,200
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

127
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:46,840
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

128
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:53,280
♪I don't want an eternity without you♪

129
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:56,040
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

130
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,720
♪More dangerous than letting go♪

131
00:07:57,720 --> 00:08:00,920
♪At least we were real in this moment♪

132
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,600
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

133
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,720
♪In every life where I have you♪

134
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:12,440
♪I choose you in every lifetime
and every day♪

135
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,360
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

136
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,400
♪Is nothing but a poor attempt
to fool myself♪

137
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,440
♪If I could really stay away♪

138
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,280
♪Then this wouldn't be longing♪

139
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:22,480
