143
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:35,120
There's something I never told you.

144
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,440
This ring

145
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,080
is a family heirloom.

146
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,920
My grandma told me herself.

147
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:44,360
She said

148
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,480
this ring

149
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,440
was meant for her future
granddaughter-in-law.

150
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,840
Are you proposing to me?

151
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,440
But...

152
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:02,080
