the company's enemies.

159
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,440
Then,

160
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,120
Chen Cong came after me too,

161
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,160
and he set his sights on you.

162
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,840
If he knew about us,

163
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,560
