even harder for you.

164
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,960
So you were just putting on
an act before?

165
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,200
Yeah.

166
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,600
But whenever I saw you
and Zhang Jinghang

167
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,000
getting so close,

168
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,120
I was still

169
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:41,600
really...

170
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,240
There's nothing between
Zhang Jinghang and me.

171
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,600
We're just friends.

172
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,440
I wanted to explain,

173
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,280
but you were always

174
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,480
so mean to me.

175
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,880
Why would I explain anything to you?

176
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,440
Alright.

177
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,600
Give me your hand.

178
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:25,400
Hello?

179
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,160
Xiyu,

180
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,960
Zhang Jinghang got into a fight
with Wang Haotian near the bar.

181
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,160
His hand was injured.

182
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,760
He's already been taken into surgery.

